flowchart TD
    In["frame arrives on bridge port<br/><b>does:</b> carries src MAC, dst MAC, VLAN, ingress port<br/><b>why next:</b> bridge must learn source before forwarding destination<br/><b>state:</b> skb associated with br_port"]
    Learn["FDB learn source<br/><b>does:</b> records src MAC/VLAN -> ingress port and refreshes age<br/><b>why next:</b> future reverse traffic can be unicast<br/><b>state:</b> forwarding database updated"]
    STP{"port forwarding?<br/><b>does:</b> checks STP/bridge state and policy<br/><b>why next:</b> blocked ports must not forward loops<br/><b>state:</b> frame allowed or dropped"}
    Lookup["FDB lookup destination<br/><b>does:</b> searches dst MAC/VLAN in bridge table<br/><b>why next:</b> known unicast has one output port; unknown must flood<br/><b>state:</b> destination port or miss"]
    Forward["known-unicast forward<br/><b>does:</b> clones/queues frame to learned output port<br/><b>why next:</b> egress port qdisc/driver transmits<br/><b>state:</b> single egress skb"]
    Flood["unknown/broadcast/multicast flood<br/><b>does:</b> sends copies to eligible ports except ingress<br/><b>why next:</b> destination may be behind any port<br/><b>state:</b> multiple cloned skbs"]
    Drop["drop<br/><b>does:</b> consumes frame due to blocked state or policy<br/><b>state:</b> no egress"]

    In --> Learn --> STP
    STP -->|yes| Lookup
    STP -->|no| Drop
    Lookup -->|hit| Forward
    Lookup -->|miss / broadcast| Flood

    classDef br fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    class In,Learn,Lookup,STP br
    class Forward,Flood ok
    class Drop bad
